#Arithmetic and Functional Programming
The arithmetic usual in Prolog has been generalized in
HU-Prolog in several directions.
- the operators known from C have been adopted, as far as
  they are compatible with the basic concepts of Prolog.
- the standard functions of the C math library have been
  adopted.
- functional evaluation of predicates and the use of
  global, structured variables are supported.

@Standard Functions and Operations
@Global Variables and User-Defined Functions
